  "decision": "Keep storage/arithmetic precision distinct. Test controlled cancellation with exactly representable outputs and BF16-representable operands under HiFi4/HiFi3 before choosing compensated attention math. This synthetic diagnostic does not attribute all full-model error or establish sampler quality.",
  "tests": "Four CPU quantization tests pass: signed truncation, round-to-even ties and exact BF16 representability. Four native cases repeat exactly with no fallback or aten counters.",
